<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Coffee Lab OS - Daily Brewing & Live Pantry Protocol</title>
<style>
  :root {
    --bg: #090a0f;
    --card: #13141f;
    --card-inner: #191b28;
    --border: #26293d;
    --accent: #d97706;
    --accent-light: #f59e0b;
    --blue: #38bdf8;
    --green: #34d399;
    --purple: #a78bfa;
    --text-main: #f8fafc;
    --text-sub: #94a3b8;
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; }
  body { background: var(--bg); color: var(--text-main); line-height: 1.5; padding-bottom: 60px; }
  
  .navbar {
    background: #0d0e17;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    position: sticky;
    top: 0;
    z-index: 100;
    padding: 12px 20px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; }
  .brand h1 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.5px; }
  .brand span { font-size: 11px; background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.2); color: var(--accent-light); padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; }
  
  .nav-tabs { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .tab-btn {
    background: #191a27;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: var(--text-sub);
    padding: 8px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }
  .tab-btn:hover { background: #222538; color: #fff; }
  .tab-btn.active { background: var(--accent); color: #fff; border-color: var(--accent); }

  .container { max-width: 1200px; margin: 24px auto; padding: 0 16px; }
  .app-section { display: none; }
  .app-section.active { display: block; }

  .grid-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .card {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    transition: border-color 0.15s;
  }
  .card:hover { border-color: #3b4263; }
  
  .badge { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 7px; border-radius: 4px; display: inline-block; }
  .badge-light { background: #78350f; color: #fde68a; }
  .badge-med { background: #065f46; color: #a7f3d0; }
  .badge-dark { background: #1e293b; color: #cbd5e1; border: 1px solid #334155; }

  .calc-box {
    background: var(--card);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .calc-title { font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 16px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
  
  .control-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 14px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
  .control-group label { display: block; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--text-sub); margin-bottom: 6px; text-transform: uppercase; }
  select, input {
    width: 100%;
    background: var(--card-inner);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
    outline: none;
  }
  select:focus, input:focus { border-color: var(--accent); }

  .spec-banner {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(130px, 1fr));
    gap: 12px;
    background: var(--card-inner);
    padding: 14px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .spec-banner .item { font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-sub); }
  .spec-banner .item b { display: block; font-size: 15px; color: #fff; margin-top: 2px; }
  .spec-banner .item b span { color: var(--accent-light); font-size: 12px; }

  .pour-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 12px; font-size: 13px; }
  .pour-table th { background: #1a1c2b; color: var(--blue); text-align: left; padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .pour-table td { padding: 9px 12px; border: 1px solid var(--border); background: #12131f; }
  .pour-table tr:nth-child(even) td { background: #161725; }

  .callout {
    background: rgba(217, 119, 6, 0.1);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 0 8px 8px 0;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    color: #cbd5e1;
    margin-top: 16px;
  }
  .callout b { color: var(--accent-light); }

  .btn {
    background: var(--accent);
    color: white;
    border: none;
    padding: 9px 14px;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .btn:hover { opacity: 0.9; }
  .btn-danger { background: #991b1b; color: white; padding: 3px 7px; font-size: 10.5px; border-radius: 4px; border: none; cursor: pointer; }

  .arsenal-item {
    background: #191b28;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border-radius: 8px;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="navbar">
  <div class="brand">
    <h1>☕ COFFEE LAB OS</h1>
    <span>From Sai' Competition Lab</span>
  </div>
  <div class="nav-tabs">
    <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab('recipeEngine')">🎯 Recipe Engine</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('livePantry')">📋 Live Pantry</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('equipmentTab')">⚙️ Equipment Arsenal</button>
    <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab('addCoffeeTab')">➕ Add New Coffee</button>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="container">

  <!-- TAB 1: RECIPE ENGINE -->
  <div id="recipeEngine" class="app-section active">
    <div class="calc-box">
      <div class="calc-title">
        <span>⚡ Dynamic Extraction Calculator</span>
        <span style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-sub); font-weight:normal;">Pair any Bean with your Equipment</span>
      </div>

      <div class="control-grid">
        <div class="control-group">
          <label>Select Coffee</label>
          <select id="calcCoffeeSelect" onchange="calculateRecipe()"></select>
        </div>

        <div class="control-group">
          <label>Brew Method</label>
          <select id="calcMethodSelect" onchange="calculateRecipe()">
            <option value="hot">🔥 Hot Pour-Over</option>
            <option value="iced">❄️ Japanese Iced Flash Brew</option>
            <option value="cold">🧊 Cold Immersion / Toddy</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="control-group">
          <label>Select Dripper / Brewer</label>
          <select id="calcBrewerSelect" onchange="calculateRecipe()">
            <option value="auto">✨ Auto-Select Best Paired Brewer</option>
          </select>
        </div>

        <div class="control-group">
          <label>Dose (Grams)</label>
          <input type="number" id="calcDoseInput" value="15.0" step="0.5" min="10" max="40" onchange="calculateRecipe()">
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="spec-banner" id="specBanner"></div>
      <div id="timelineContainer"></div>
      <div class="callout" id="calloutRationale"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TAB 2: LIVE PANTRY -->
  <div id="livePantry" class="app-section">
    <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center; margin-bottom:12px; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px;">
      <div>
        <h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:800;">📋 Live Bean Pantry</h2>
        <p style="color:var(--text-sub); font-size:13px;">Tracks resting time & integrates directly with recipes</p>
      </div>
      <button class="btn" onclick="switchTab('addCoffeeTab')">+ Add New Bag</button>
    </div>
    <div class="grid-3" id="pantryGrid"></div>
  </div>

  <!-- TAB 3: EQUIPMENT ARSENAL -->
  <div id="equipmentTab" class="app-section">
    <h2 style="font-size:20px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:12px;">⚙️ Equipment Arsenal</h2>
    <div class="calc-box">
      <h3 style="font-size:15px; margin-bottom:12px; color:var(--blue);">Active Pour-Over Drippers</h3>
      <div id="drippersListContainer"></div>
      <div style="margin-top:16px; border-top:1px solid var(--border); padding-top:14px;">
        <h4 style="font-size:13px; margin-bottom:8px; color:var(--text-sub);">Add New Dripper to Arsenal</h4>
        <div style="display:flex; gap:10px; flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <input type="text" id="newBrewerName" placeholder="e.g. Hario Switch 03, April Dripper..." style="flex:2; min-width:200px;">
          <select id="newBrewerDrainage" style="flex:1; min-width:140px;">
            <option value="fast">Fast Conical Flow</option>
            <option value="medium">Medium Flat-bed Flow</option>
            <option value="restricted">Restricted / Wedge Flow</option>
          </select>
          <button class="btn" onclick="addNewDripper()">+ Add Dripper</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="calc-box">
      <h3 style="font-size:15px; margin-bottom:10px; color:var(--accent-light);">Manual Grinders Configured</h3>
      <div class="arsenal-item">
        <div><b>Timemore C3S:</b> 38mm S2C Burrs • Internal Adjustment</div>
      </div>
      <div class="arsenal-item">
        <div><b>1Zpresso ZP6 Special:</b> 48mm Hexagonal Burrs • External Top Collar</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- TAB 4: ADD COFFEE FORM -->
  <div id="addCoffeeTab" class="app-section">
    <div class="calc-box" style="max-width:700px; margin:0 auto;">
      <h2 style="font-size:18px; font-weight:800; margin-bottom:16px;">➕ Add Coffee Lot to Live Pantry</h2>
      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; margin-bottom:14px;">
        <div class="control-group">
          <label>Coffee Name & Lot</label>
          <input type="text" id="addName" placeholder="e.g. Ratnagiri Estate Lot 12">
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
          <label>Roaster</label>
          <input type="text" id="addRoaster" placeholder="e.g. Subko, Grey Soul, Broot">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; margin-bottom:14px;">
        <div class="control-group">
          <label>Roast Level</label>
          <select id="addRoast">
            <option value="Ultra-Light">Ultra-Light</option>
            <option value="Medium-Light">Medium-Light</option>
            <option value="Medium">Medium</option>
            <option value="Medium-Dark">Medium-Dark</option>
            <option value="Dark">Dark</option>
          </select>
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
          <label>Process</label>
          <input type="text" id="addProcess" placeholder="e.g. Wine Yeast Anoxic, Washed, Honey">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; margin-bottom:14px;">
        <div class="control-group">
          <label>Varietal</label>
          <input type="text" id="addVarietal" placeholder="e.g. Obata, SLN 795, Peaberry">
        </div>
        <div class="control-group">
          <label>Roast Date</label>
          <input type="date" id="addRoastDate">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="control-group" style="margin-bottom:14px;">
        <label>Tasting Notes</label>
        <input type="text" id="addNotes" placeholder="e.g. Mango, Jasmine, Plum, Fudge">
      </div>
      <div class="control-group" style="margin-bottom:20px;">
        <label>Best Matched Dripper</label>
        <select id="addDefaultDripper"></select>
      </div>
      <button class="btn" style="width:100%; padding:12px;" onclick="saveNewCoffee()">Save to Pantry & Storage</button>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<script>
const defaultCoffees = [
  { id: "subko-ratnagiri", name: "Subko - Ratnagiri Estate (Pearl)", roaster: "Subko", roast: "Ultra-Light", process: "Culture Naturals + Anaerobic", varietal: "Catuai & Hemavathi", roastDate: "2026-08-28", defaultBrewer: "origami", notes: "Marigold, Dragon Fruit, Peach Iced-Tea", hotTemp: 92, hotRatio: 17, c3sHot: 13, zp6Hot: 4.2, flowNote: "Origami flutes maximize peach iced-tea florals while bypassing heavy ferment funk." },
  { id: "pink-lemonade", name: "Grey Soul - Pink Lemonade (#5)", roaster: "Grey Soul", roast: "Ultra-Light", process: "Sun-Dried Anaerobic Natural", varietal: "Specialty Arabica Lot #5", roastDate: "2026-08-25", defaultBrewer: "origami", notes: "Candied Strawberry, Citrus Malic Brightness, Fig Base", hotTemp: 96, hotRatio: 15, c3sHot: 11, zp6Hot: 3.9, flowNote: "Dense ultra-light cells need near-boiling water (96-97°C) & 5 pulses to dissolve berry sugars and prevent savory lentil flaw." },
  { id: "broot-sur-lie", name: "Broot - SUR LIE (Melkodige)", roaster: "Broot Coffee", roast: "Medium-Light", process: "Wine Yeast Anoxic Natural", varietal: "Obata", roastDate: "2026-09-03", defaultBrewer: "origami", notes: "Red Grape, Dried Fig, Jasmine Lift, Wine Finish", hotTemp: 92, hotRatio: 16.3, c3sHot: 13, zp6Hot: 4.3, flowNote: "Origami fast drain lets delicate wine yeast jasmine & grape volatiles lift without harsh boozy astringency." },
  { id: "moss-theory", name: "Broot - Moss Theory (Kerehaklu)", roaster: "Broot Coffee", roast: "Medium-Light", process: "Extended Aerobic SLN9 Peaberry", varietal: "SLN9 Peaberry", roastDate: "2026-08-26", defaultBrewer: "neo", notes: "Golden Mango, Pink Guava Nectar, Syrupy Body", hotTemp: 92, hotRatio: 16, c3sHot: 14, zp6Hot: 4.5, flowNote: "Neo V60's rapid spiral channels accelerate tropical mango extraction across dense peaberries." },
  { id: "salawara-estate", name: "Blue Tokai - Salawara Estate", roaster: "Blue Tokai", roast: "Light", process: "Anaerobic Natural", varietal: "SLN 795", roastDate: "2026-08-20", defaultBrewer: "ceramic", notes: "Crisp Red Apple, Stewed Pear, Toasted Almond", hotTemp: 92, hotRatio: 16, c3sHot: 14, zp6Hot: 4.4, flowNote: "High thermal mass of Ceramic V60 converts malic apple acidity into baked, sweet caramel warmth." },
  { id: "raxidi-lobo", name: "Roastery - Raxidi Lobo Estate", roaster: "Roastery Coffee", roast: "Medium", process: "5B Block Anaerobic Natural", varietal: "SLN 5B", roastDate: "2026-08-18", defaultBrewer: "origami", notes: "Dark Cherry Jam, Boozy Plum, Cocoa, Grapefruit", hotTemp: 90, hotRatio: 16, c3sHot: 14, zp6Hot: 4.8, flowNote: "Origami prevents the 3-hole pooling stall of Kalita 102; laminar center stream skips bitter tannins." },
  { id: "mizoram-reserve", name: "Grey Soul - Mizoram Reserve (#4)", roaster: "Grey Soul", roast: "Medium-Dark", process: "Sun-Dried Natural", varietal: "Regional Natural Lot", roastDate: "2026-08-15", defaultBrewer: "balloon", notes: "Watermelon Candy, Ripe Plum, Hazelnut Cocoa", hotTemp: 90, hotRatio: 16, c3sHot: 15, zp6Hot: 5.2, flowNote: "Balloon glass bulb reservoir enhances body and syrupiness, bringing out juicy watermelon candy sweetness." },
  { id: "sholiga", name: "Veer Attikan - Sholiga", roaster: "Veer Attikan", roast: "Light-Medium", process: "Washed Arabica", varietal: "Single Origin BR Hills", roastDate: "2026-08-10", defaultBrewer: "ceramic", notes: "Honeyed Jackfruit, Dried Dates, Brown Sugar", hotTemp: 91, hotRatio: 16, c3sHot: 15, zp6Hot: 4.8, flowNote: "Classic washed profile; gentle concentric spirals in ceramic cone give comforting dates and sugar." },
  { id: "aramse-bold", name: "Aramse - Bold Edition #2", roaster: "Aramse", roast: "Dark", process: "Salawara Honey / Washed", varietal: "Specialty Dark Blend", roastDate: "2026-08-12", defaultBrewer: "kalita", notes: "Dark Fudge, Molasses, Stewed Plum, Zero Ash", hotTemp: 88, hotRatio: 15, c3sHot: 17, zp6Hot: 5.8, flowNote: "Kalita 102 wedge with oval racetrack pour and 88°C water pulls dense fudge body without astringency." },
  { id: "ph-seven-robusta", name: "PH-Seven - 100% Robusta-AA", roaster: "PH-Seven", roast: "Medium-Dark", process: "High-Grown Washed Robusta", varietal: "Robusta-AA", roastDate: "2026-08-05", defaultBrewer: "kalita", notes: "Dark Cacao, Clove, Nutmeg, Velvety Crema", hotTemp: 87, hotRatio: 14, c3sHot: 17, zp6Hot: 6.0, flowNote: "Low temperature (87°C) & short ratio (1:14) extract warm baking spices and cocoa while leaving ash behind." },
  { id: "tim-hortons-signature", name: "Tim Hortons - Signature India", roaster: "Tim Hortons", roast: "Medium", process: "Commercial Washed Blend", varietal: "Whole Bean Blend", roastDate: "2026-08-01", defaultBrewer: "neo", notes: "Milk Chocolate, Toasted Cereal, Mellow Acidity", hotTemp: 90, hotRatio: 16, c3sHot: 15, zp6Hot: 5.0, flowNote: "Amber Neo V60's rapid fluting flushes out clean morning chocolate without bitter over-steeping." }
];

const defaultDrippers = {
  origami: { name: "Ivory Origami 02 (Conical)", flow: "fast" },
  neo: { name: "Amber Neo V60 (Spiral Ribs)", flow: "fast" },
  balloon: { name: "Balloon-Glass V60 (Curved Body)", flow: "medium" },
  ceramic: { name: "Ceramic V60 (Thermal Mass)", flow: "medium" },
  kalita: { name: "Kalita 102-D (Wedge 3-Hole)", flow: "restricted" }
};

let storedCoffees = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('sai_coffees')) || defaultCoffees;
let storedDrippers = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem('sai_drippers')) || defaultDrippers;

function saveState() {
  localStorage.setItem('sai_coffees', JSON.stringify(storedCoffees));
  localStorage.setItem('sai_drippers', JSON.stringify(storedDrippers));
}

function switchTab(tabId) {
  document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn').forEach(btn => btn.classList.remove('active'));
  document.querySelectorAll('.app-section').forEach(sec => sec.classList.remove('active'));
  document.getElementById(tabId).classList.add('active');
  const activeBtn = Array.from(document.querySelectorAll('.tab-btn')).find(b => b.getAttribute('onclick').includes(tabId));
  if (activeBtn) activeBtn.classList.add('active');
}

function initApp() {
  renderBrewerDropdowns();
  renderCoffeeDropdown();
  renderPantry();
  renderEquipmentList();
  calculateRecipe();
}

function renderBrewerDropdowns() {
  const calcSelect = document.getElementById('calcBrewerSelect');
  const addSelect = document.getElementById('addDefaultDripper');
  calcSelect.innerHTML = '<option value="auto">✨ Auto-Select Best Paired Brewer</option>';
  addSelect.innerHTML = '';

  Object.keys(storedDrippers).forEach(k => {
    const opt = document.createElement('option');
    opt.value = k;
    opt.textContent = storedDrippers[k].name;
    calcSelect.appendChild(opt);

    const opt2 = document.createElement('option');
    opt2.value = k;
    opt2.textContent = storedDrippers[k].name;
    addSelect.appendChild(opt2);
  });
}

function renderCoffeeDropdown() {
  const select = document.getElementById('calcCoffeeSelect');
  select.innerHTML = '';
  storedCoffees.forEach(c => {
    const opt = document.createElement('option');
    opt.value = c.id;
    opt.textContent = `${c.name} (${c.roast})`;
    select.appendChild(opt);
  });
}

function renderEquipmentList() {
  const container = document.getElementById('drippersListContainer');
  container.innerHTML = '';
  Object.keys(storedDrippers).forEach(k => {
    const item = document.createElement('div');
    item.className = 'arsenal-item';
    item.innerHTML = `
      <div>
        <b>${storedDrippers[k].name}</b> 
        <span style="font-size:11px; color:var(--text-sub); margin-left:8px;">[Flow: ${storedDrippers[k].flow}]</span>
      </div>
      ${!defaultDrippers[k] ? `<button class="btn-danger" onclick="deleteDripper('${k}')">Remove</button>` : ''}
    `;
    container.appendChild(item);
  });
}

function addNewDripper() {
  const name = document.getElementById('newBrewerName').value.trim();
  const flow = document.getElementById('newBrewerDrainage').value;
  if (!name) return alert("Please enter dripper name");
  const id = "drip_" + Date.now();
  storedDrippers[id] = { name: name, flow: flow };
  saveState();
  document.getElementById('newBrewerName').value = '';
  renderBrewerDropdowns();
  renderEquipmentList();
  calculateRecipe();
  alert("Dripper added!");
}

function deleteDripper(k) {
  if (confirm("Remove this dripper?")) {
    delete storedDrippers[k];
    saveState();
    renderBrewerDropdowns();
    renderEquipmentList();
    calculateRecipe();
  }
}

function renderPantry() {
  const grid = document.getElementById('pantryGrid');
  grid.innerHTML = '';
  const now = new Date("2026-09-13");

  storedCoffees.forEach(c => {
    const rDate = new Date(c.roastDate);
    const diff = Math.floor((now - rDate) / (1000 * 60 * 60 * 24));
    let badgeClass = 'badge-med';
    if (c.roast.includes('Light')) badgeClass = 'badge-light';
    else if (c.roast.includes('Dark')) badgeClass = 'badge-dark';

    const card = document.createElement('div');
    card.className = 'card';
    const dripperName = storedDrippers[c.defaultBrewer] ? storedDrippers[c.defaultBrewer].name : "Origami / V60";

    card.innerHTML = `
      <div style="display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:flex-start; margin-bottom:8px;">
        <span class="badge ${badgeClass}">${c.roast}</span>
        <span style="font-size:11px; color:var(--accent-light); font-weight:700;">Day ${diff >= 0 ? diff : 0} rested</span>
      </div>
      <h3 style="font-size:15px; font-weight:700; margin-bottom:4px;">${c.name}</h3>
      <p style="font-size:12px; color:var(--text-sub); margin-bottom:6px;">${c.roaster} • ${c.process}</p>
      <p style="font-size:12px; color:var(--purple); font-style:italic; margin-bottom:12px;">Notes: ${c.notes}</p>
      <div style="background:var(--card-inner); padding:8px 10px; border-radius:6px; font-size:11.5px; border:1px solid var(--border); margin-bottom:12px;">
        <div><b>Best Dripper:</b> <span style="color:var(--blue);">${dripperName}</span></div>
        <div><b>Hot Dial-In:</b> C3S: ${c.c3sHot} clk | ZP6: ${c.zp6Hot} @ ${c.hotTemp}°C</div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:flex; gap:8px;">
        <button class="btn" style="flex:1;" onclick="brewSpecificCoffee('${c.id}')">⚡ Dial-In</button>
        ${!defaultCoffees.some(dc => dc.id === c.id) ? `<button class="btn-danger" onclick="deleteCoffee('${c.id}')">Delete</button>` : ''}
      </div>
    `;
    grid.appendChild(card);
  });
}

function brewSpecificCoffee(id) {
  document.getElementById('calcCoffeeSelect').value = id;
  document.getElementById('calcBrewerSelect').value = "auto";
  switchTab('recipeEngine');
  calculateRecipe();
}

function saveNewCoffee() {
  const name = document.getElementById('addName').value.trim();
  const roaster = document.getElementById('addRoaster').value.trim();
  const roast = document.getElementById('addRoast').value;
  const process = document.getElementById('addProcess').value.trim();
  const varietal = document.getElementById('addVarietal').value.trim();
  const rDate = document.getElementById('addRoastDate').value || "2026-09-13";
  const notes = document.getElementById('addNotes').value.trim();
  const brewer = document.getElementById('addDefaultDripper').value;

  if (!name || !roaster) return alert("Please fill Coffee Name and Roaster");

  let temp = 92; let ratio = 16; let c3s = 14; let zp6 = 4.5;
  if (roast === 'Ultra-Light') { temp = 96; ratio = 15; c3s = 12; zp6 = 4.0; }
  else if (roast === 'Medium-Light') { temp = 93; ratio = 16; c3s = 13; zp6 = 4.3; }
  else if (roast === 'Medium') { temp = 90; ratio = 16; c3s = 14; zp6 = 4.8; }
  else if (roast === 'Medium-Dark') { temp = 89; ratio = 15.5; c3s = 15; zp6 = 5.2; }
  else if (roast === 'Dark') { temp = 87; ratio = 14.5; c3s = 17; zp6 = 5.8; }

  const newBean = {
    id: "bean_" + Date.now(),
    name: `${roaster} - ${name}`,
    roaster: roaster,
    roast: roast,
    process: process || "Natural",
    varietal: varietal || "Arabica",
    roastDate: rDate,
    defaultBrewer: brewer,
    notes: notes || "Fresh specialty roast",
    hotTemp: temp,
    hotRatio: ratio,
    c3sHot: c3s,
    zp6Hot: zp6,
    flowNote: "First-principles calibrated recipe generated automatically from roast and process."
  };

  storedCoffees.unshift(newBean);
  saveState();
  renderCoffeeDropdown();
  renderPantry();
  brewSpecificCoffee(newBean.id);
  alert("Coffee added to pantry and loaded in Recipe Engine!");
}

function deleteCoffee(id) {
  if (confirm("Delete this coffee from your pantry?")) {
    storedCoffees = storedCoffees.filter(c => c.id !== id);
    saveState();
    renderCoffeeDropdown();
    renderPantry();
    calculateRecipe();
  }
}

function calculateRecipe() {
  const coffeeId = document.getElementById('calcCoffeeSelect').value;
  const method = document.getElementById('calcMethodSelect').value;
  const brewerChoice = document.getElementById('calcBrewerSelect').value;
  const dose = parseFloat(document.getElementById('calcDoseInput').value) || 15.0;

  const coffee = storedCoffees.find(c => c.id === coffeeId) || storedCoffees[0];
  const activeBrewerKey = brewerChoice === "auto" ? coffee.defaultBrewer : brewerChoice;
  const brewerObj = storedDrippers[activeBrewerKey] || defaultDrippers.origami;

  let c3s = coffee.c3sHot;
  let zp6 = parseFloat(coffee.zp6Hot);
  let temp = coffee.hotTemp;
  let totalWater = Math.round(dose * coffee.hotRatio);
  let ratioDisplay = `1 : ${coffee.hotRatio}`;
  let iceGrams = 0;
  let hotWaterGrams = totalWater;

  if (brewerObj.flow === 'restricted') {
    c3s += 2;
    zp6 = (zp6 + 0.8).toFixed(1);
    temp = Math.max(86, temp - 2);
  } else if (brewerObj.flow === 'medium') {
    c3s += 1;
    zp6 = (zp6 + 0.3).toFixed(1);
  } else {
    zp6 = zp6.toFixed(1);
  }

  if (method === 'iced') {
    totalWater = Math.round(dose * 15.0);
    iceGrams = Math.round(totalWater * 0.375);
    hotWaterGrams = totalWater - iceGrams;
    ratioDisplay = `1 : 15 (Flash: ${hotWaterGrams}g Hot + ${iceGrams}g Ice)`;
    c3s = Math.max(10, c3s - 2);
    zp6 = (parseFloat(zp6) - 0.7).toFixed(1);
    temp = Math.min(97, temp + 2);
  } else if (method === 'cold') {
    totalWater = Math.round(dose * 12.0);
    ratioDisplay = `1 : 12 Immersion`;
    c3s = 20;
    zp6 = "7.0";
    temp = "Room Temp (25°C)";
  }

  const specBanner = document.getElementById('specBanner');
  specBanner.innerHTML = `
    <div class="item">Active Brewer<b>${brewerObj.name}</b></div>
    <div class="item">Coffee Dose<b>${dose.toFixed(1)}g</b></div>
    <div class="item">Total Liquid<b>${totalWater}g <span>(${ratioDisplay})</span></b></div>
    <div class="item">Water Temp<b>${typeof temp === 'number' ? temp + '°C' : temp}</b></div>
    <div class="item">Timemore C3S<b>${c3s} clicks</b></div>
    <div class="item">1Zpresso ZP6<b>Dial ${zp6}</b></div>
  `;

  const timeline = document.getElementById('timelineContainer');
  const rationale = document.getElementById('calloutRationale');

  if (method === 'hot') {
    const bloom = Math.round(dose * 3.0);
    const p1 = Math.round((hotWaterGrams - bloom) * 0.48);
    const p2 = hotWaterGrams - bloom - p1;

    let action1 = brewerObj.flow === 'restricted' ? "Oval racetrack pour along wedge seam" : "Concentric spiral from center outward to 1cm from edge";
    let action2 = brewerObj.flow === 'restricted' ? "Gentle center pulse. Lift kettle before stall" : "Gentle laminar center pour (low height, low turbulence)";

    timeline.innerHTML = `
      <table class="pour-table">
        <tr><th>Stage & Time</th><th>Water Dose</th><th>Total Water</th><th>Pour Flow Dynamics (${brewerObj.name})</th></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Stage 1 (Bloom):</b> 0:00 – 0:40</td><td>${bloom}g</td><td>${bloom}g</td><td>Rapid saturation in 10s. ${brewerObj.flow === 'restricted' ? 'No swirl (prevents clogging pinholes).' : '1-2 gentle swirls to vent CO2.'}</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Stage 2 (Acidity):</b> 0:40 – 1:15</td><td>+${p1}g</td><td>${bloom + p1}g</td><td>${action1}.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Stage 3 (Sweetness):</b> 1:20 – 1:55</td><td>+${p2}g</td><td>${hotWaterGrams}g</td><td>${action2}. Target: 2:20 – 2:45.</td></tr>
      </table>
    `;
    rationale.innerHTML = `<b>Extraction Dynamics:</b> ${coffee.flowNote || 'First-principles extraction applied.'} (${brewerObj.name}: ${brewerObj.flow} drainage mechanics calibrated).`;
  } else if (method === 'iced') {
    const bloom = Math.round(dose * 2.5);
    const p1 = Math.round((hotWaterGrams - bloom) * 0.55);
    const p2 = hotWaterGrams - bloom - p1;

    timeline.innerHTML = `
      <table class="pour-table">
        <tr><th>Stage & Time</th><th>Water Dose</th><th>Total Liquid</th><th>Japanese Flash Mechanics</th></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Prep:</b> Pre-brew</td><td>${iceGrams}g Ice</td><td>${iceGrams}g</td><td>Place ${iceGrams}g hard ice cubes directly inside carafe.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Stage 1:</b> 0:00 – 0:40</td><td>${bloom}g Hot</td><td>${iceGrams + bloom}g</td><td>Saturate bed. Fast single swirl to initiate extraction over ice.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Stage 2:</b> 0:40 – 1:10</td><td>+${p1}g Hot</td><td>${iceGrams + bloom + p1}g</td><td>Slow, tight concentric pulses. High contact heat extracts volatile fruit sugars.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>Stage 3:</b> 1:15 – 1:45</td><td>+${p2}g Hot</td><td>${totalWater}g Total</td><td>Laminar center stream. Swirl carafe 15s until ice condenses volatiles.</td></tr>
      </table>
    `;
    rationale.innerHTML = `<b>Japanese Flash Rationale:</b> Grinding 2 clicks finer (C3S: ${c3s} / ZP6: ${zp6}) and brewing hot directly onto ${iceGrams}g ice locks in fruit aromatics without dilution bitterness.`;
  } else {
    timeline.innerHTML = `
      <table class="pour-table">
        <tr><th>Step</th><th>Ratio / Specs</th><th>Protocol & Immersion Dynamics</th></tr>
        <tr><td><b>1. Grind & Load</b></td><td>${dose}g coffee @ ${c3s} clicks (ZP6: ${zp6})</td><td>Coarse grind prevents astringency and muddy silts.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>2. Saturate</b></td><td>${totalWater}g Room Temp Water</td><td>Pour entire volume, gently stir 3 times to fully saturate grounds.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>3. Cold Steep</b></td><td>14 – 16 Hours in Fridge</td><td>Cap container tightly to prevent absorbing odors.</td></tr>
        <tr><td><b>4. Filtration</b></td><td>Pass through Paper V60 Filter</td><td>Straining through paper yields tea-like clarity.</td></tr>
      </table>
    `;
    rationale.innerHTML = `<b>Cold Immersion Rationale:</b> 14 hours of cold water steeping extracts sweet sucrose without dissolving heavy bitter compounds.`;
  }
}

window.onload = initApp;
</script>
</body>
</html>
